cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying analysis, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cost of Delay for Post-Quantum Migration: reference implementation, case studies and analysis"
abstract: >-
  Expresses classical and harvest-now-decrypt-later risk on the same asset as a cost of
  delay in US dollars per year, coupled through a competing-risks term, so that classical
  findings and post-quantum migration items can be ranked on one list. Includes proofs,
  a verified reference implementation, four public case studies, and an uncertainty and
  sensitivity analysis. All case-study inputs are assumptions derived from public documents.
